{
  "name": "JSON to INI",
  "description": "Convert a JSON object to INI. Top-level scalars come first, then each nested object as an [section]. Best for the flat/one-level shape; deeply nested structures do not map cleanly to INI.",
  "summary": "Convert a JSON object to INI config",
  "tags": [
